  "body": "Fork synced at v0.16.0.\n\n## What changed\n- New `Machine::rows(unit)` (`crates/post/src/machine/rows.rs`): label/value rows Kind, Machine, Spindle, Axes (each stroke), Tool changer, Coolant, Workspace. Unknowns read \"not stated\" (never `?`), lengths follow the document unit, rotary strokes stay in degrees.\n- New `machine_grid` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/machine_grid.rs`): a two-column `egui::Grid`, values word-wrap. Drawn on the Machine page (plus a Source row: \"Built-in: <name>\" or the path) and in the machine editor header.\n- `summary()` is unchanged (setup sheet, `boundary_draft`); `crates/app/tests/machine.rs` summary asserts still pass.\n- Decision record: `docs/decisions/745-machine-summary-grid.md`.\n\n## How tested\n- `crates/app/tests/machine.rs::rows_state_each_fact_and_never_a_bare_question_mark`\n- `crates/ui` lib `egui_app::tests::setup_tree::the_machine_page_shows_a_property_grid` (row labels present as separate rows, Source row, no `?`)\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main`: post suites, app suites, app machine, ui suites all ok.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-post -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` clean.\n\n## Not exercised\n- Hand test at narrow pane widths (wrap is `Label::wrap` inside a Grid; no structural overflow check). No snapshot PNGs changed.\n\nChangelog: Machine page and machine editor show the machine overview as a two-column property grid with \"not stated\" for unknowns (#745)\nEffort: medium\n\nFixes #745\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
